  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/656/656-19.htm",
  "statuteText": "656:19 Number. –\n\nAt each state general election, the secretary of state shall furnish each town or city the state general election ballots in a number which the secretary of state shall deem sufficient for voting in the state general election."
